; Disabled is the single most-used state in the shop -- every element button
; goes disabled the moment gold runs short (main.gd `_refresh_gold`). It has to
; read as "cannot afford", not as "broken", so it keeps its shape and just
; drains contrast rather than disappearing.

[sub_resource type="StyleBoxFlat" id="btn_disabled"]
